// The world map (--ent-world-map, for `ent map`): what the world is made
// of, what each system does to it, how schedules would be staged and why
// a run waits, and the entities' lifecycle along `main`. A lamp is made,
// lit, put out and done (`Done` is apart: a move to another archetype),
// and the done go.
// RUN: ent-translate --import-ent %S/Inputs/world_map/life.ent \
// RUN:     -I %S/../../devices --mlir-print-debuginfo -o %t.mlir
// RUN: ent-opt %t.mlir --ent-world-map=out=%t.map -o /dev/null
// RUN: tr '\t' '|' < %t.map | FileCheck %s
// Only the components named are told apart; queries' tests of the
// others may hold or not.
// RUN: ent-opt %t.mlir "--ent-world-map=lens=Done" -o /dev/null \
// RUN:   | tr '\t' '|' | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LENS

// CHECK:      ent-map|1
// CHECK:      component|Lamp|heat|life.ent:3|0
// CHECK:      component|Done||life.ent:5|1
// CHECK:      resource|Clock|n|life.ent:6
// CHECK:      archetype|0|Lamp_archetype|64|1|Lamp|Lit|Lamp
// CHECK-NEXT: archetype|1|Lamp_Done|64|1|Lamp,Done|Lit|Done
// CHECK:      system|make|life.ent:9|0|
// CHECK:      change|make|life.ent:9|spawn||Lamp_archetype||
// CHECK:      change|dim|life.ent:20|add|Done|Lamp_archetype|move|Lamp_Done
// CHECK-NEXT: change|dim|life.ent:20|add|Done|Lamp_Done|overwrite|
// CHECK:      query|reap|life.ent:24|1
// CHECK:      run|frame|0|light|0||
// CHECK-NEXT: run|frame|1|dim|1|light|it writes Lamp_archetype.Lit?, which @light also writes
// CHECK-NEXT: run|frame|2|reap|2|dim|it writes entities, which @dim also writes
// CHECK-NEXT: run|frame|3|tick|0||
// CHECK:      lens|Done,Lit
// CHECK-NEXT: call|start|0
// CHECK-NEXT: call|frame|1
// CHECK-NEXT: state|0|0|
// CHECK-NEXT: state|1|0|Lit
// CHECK-NEXT: state|2|1|Lit
// CHECK-NEXT: state|3|1|
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|0|start|0|make|-1|0|spawn|life.ent:9
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|1|frame|0|light|0|1|add Lit|life.ent:13
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|1|frame|0|light|3|2|add Lit|life.ent:13
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|2|frame|1|dim|1|0|remove Lit|life.ent:19
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|2|frame|1|dim|1|2|add Done|life.ent:20
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|2|frame|1|dim|1|3|remove Lit, add Done|life.ent:19, life.ent:20
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|2|frame|1|dim|2|3|remove Lit|life.ent:19
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|3|frame|2|reap|2|-2|despawn|life.ent:24
// CHECK-NEXT: flow|3|frame|2|reap|3|-2|despawn|life.ent:24
// CHECK-NOT:  flow

// LENS:      lens|Done
// LENS:      state|0|0|
// LENS-NEXT: state|1|1|
// LENS-NEXT: flow|0|start|0|make|-1|0|spawn|life.ent:9
// (Steps are numbered among the runs that change a state: `light` does
// none here.)
// LENS-NEXT: flow|1|frame|1|dim|0|1|add Done|life.ent:20
// LENS-NEXT: flow|2|frame|2|reap|1|-2|despawn|life.ent:24
// LENS-NOT:  flow
